# Optional: reliable debrief email delivery (free tier at https://web3forms.com).
# Sign up with hoyoon@stanford.edu, create an access key, paste it here, then rename to .env
#
# Vercel: Settings → Environment Variables → add VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY for
